    "Conduck connects straight to your AI — we never see your data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck 直接连接你的 AI，我们从不接触你的数据。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck conecta directamente con tu IA: nunca vemos tus datos."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ConduckはAIに直接接続します。私たちがデータを見ることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduck couldn't send what you shared. Try sharing it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck 无法发送共享内容，请重新共享。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck no pudo enviar lo que compartiste. Vuelve a compartirlo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "共有した内容をConduckから送信できませんでした。もう一度共有してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduck doesn't know which AI to use for new chats. Open Conduck to pick one?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Conduck doesn't know which AI to use for new chats. Open Conduck to pick one?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck 尚未确定新对话使用哪个 AI。要打开 Conduck 选择吗？"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck no sabe qué IA usar para los chats nuevos. ¿Abrir Conduck para elegir una?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新しいチャットに使うAIが設定されていません。Conduckを開いて選びますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduck doesn't know which AI to use. Choose one from the list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck 尚未确定使用哪个 AI，请从列表中选择。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck no sabe qué IA usar. Elige una de la lista."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用するAIが設定されていません。リストから選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduck is a client, not an AI service — it has no AI of its own. Think of it like a remote control that talks to the AI you set up and run yourself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck 是客户端，本身不提供 AI 服务。你可以把它当作遥控器，用来与自己设置和运行的 AI 通信。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck es un cliente, no un servicio de IA: no tiene una IA propia. Es como un mando a distancia que habla con la IA que tú configuras y ejecutas."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ConduckはAIサービスではなく、独自のAIを持たないクライアントです。自分で設定・運用するAIを操作するリモコンのように使えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduck needs your AI running as a server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck 需要你的 AI 以服务器形式运行。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck necesita que tu IA funcione como servidor."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduckを使うには、AIをサーバーとして稼働させる必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduck needs your Microphone and Speech Recognition to turn speech into text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck 需要麦克风和语音识别权限，才能将语音转换为文字。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduck necesita tu micrófono y el reconocimiento de voz para convertir la voz en texto."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduckで音声をテキストにするには、マイクと音声認識へのアクセスが必要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduck needs your microphone and Speech Recognition to turn speech into text." : {
